## Non-negotiable content rule

**Never fabricate, exaggerate, or invent experience, metrics, skills, or claims.** Every fact
below must be verified against your actual resume, real project repos/code, and original
source material. If a job posting asks for a skill or experience not listed here, the skills
in this system should not add it to look like a better fit — they should either skip it, or
explicitly and honestly name the gap in the cover letter.

